person in front of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/fb61793845c89659e03e2578252505bd.poster.avif?t=1781771581\" width=1084 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/fb61793845c89659e03e2578252505bd.webm?t=1781771581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/fb61793845c89659e03e2578252505bd.mp4?t=1781771581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Gather four</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll need allies. Three is too few. Five is too many.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/4bb26e2f2804f33cb0f40230396d9d1f.poster.avif?t=1781771581\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/4bb26e2f2804f33cb0f40230396d9d1f.webm?t=1781771581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/4bb26e2f2804f33cb0f40230396d9d1f.mp4?t=1781771581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Survive</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The danger isn’t only Mimesis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursed rain may fall, or monsters may appear. <strong>Stay alive</strong>, together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/aead429acd6ac5ed34578dada680c184.poster.avif?t=1781771581\" width=1170 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/aead429acd6ac5ed34578dada680c184.webm?t=1781771581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/aead429acd6ac5ed34578dada680c184.mp4?t=1781771581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Repair the tram</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s old. It could break anytime. Collect scraps. Fix it when you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/5fa6ba9f63696648cdef89b5e1b6d0f1.poster.avif?t=1781771581\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/5fa6ba9f63696648cdef89b5e1b6d0f1.webm?t=1781771581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/5fa6ba9f63696648cdef89b5e1b6d0f1.mp4?t=1781771581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alive as long as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>An enemy that mimics you</i></strong> – Mimesis copies your voice, behavior, even your memories. Can you tell what’s real and what’s not?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Up to 4 player coop survival</i></strong> – Repair the tram and survive together. But no one knows if trust will last until the end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Unpredictable horror</i></strong> – Every run brings new threats and changing environments. Collect scraps and escape before it’s too late.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join Our Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow us on Steam and join our official Discord. Find allies to play, survive, and talk with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer, 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-8100 / AMD Ryzen 3 2200G<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050 Ti 4GB / AMD RX 570 4GB<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system. Requirements to run on 1080p resolution</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer, 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9400F / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1660 Super 6GB / AMD RX590 8GB<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system. Requirements to run on 1080p resolution</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Casual","Indie","Early Access"],"developers":["ReLU Games, Inc."],"publishers":["ReLU Games, Inc.","KRAFTON, Inc."],"release_date":"27 Oct, 2025"}